Z||000009||FieroKyle||10-28-2001||01:14 PM||||I love these quotes from the adds......<P>"Fully adjustable down 26° or up 12° to add or reduce drag for a true racing experience."<BR>-What racing expierence???? I don't really think the Integra will be going to Le Mans this year and be competive with this oversized bench.<P>"For all sport compact cars"<BR>-Well no sh#t, one size fits all Caviliers and other ricer mobiles.	<BR>	<BR>"Aircraft-quality billet aluminum stanchions are fully adjustable to help achieve the "right" look plus create the perfect downward push on the rear of car"<BR>-Aircrafts are made to fly,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.	<P>"Fully adjustable—fine-tune downforce to boost your car's performance!"<BR>-I need to finely tune this sucker so I won't spin the front tires with all the hp and torque while I am racing. (823 rice horses under the hood!) At 26 degrees I can keep up with NASCAR guys at Daytona while at 24 degrees, my car is wickedly out of control while doing 198 rice miles an hour (87 mph).<P>These wings are a JOKE! <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">    <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||7
